			description: [
				" &l&#D2691EMinecolonies&r&r also offers you a ton of different          &#D2691Ecolony styles&r to choose from. Some styles might be &nmore&r  &ndifficult&r to progress through than others, so choose      wisely! Or, you could mix and match styles for each         building—who's stopping you?"
				""
				" In addition to the default colony styles that the             &#D2691E&lMinecolonies&r&r mod offers, we’ve included even more       styles with the help of the &#D2691EStylecolonies&r and &#D2691EByzantine    Style Pack&r mods!"
