		{
			dependencies: ["19C32F0E30411935"]
			description: [
				"选择殖民地建造地点&#D2691E非常重要&r，尤其是在&#D2691E&lMCC&r&r世界中。虽然建造殖民地时都适用这一原则，但此世界能帮助你规避的挑战不仅限于常规挑战，还包括更多其他挑战。"
				""
				"建立殖民地和基地时，请注意两者之间的距离非常重要&r。"
				""
				"As long as your colony is &#D2691Eloaded&r, your citizens are constantly trying to work, getting hungry, falling ill, being attacked, or even dying. If you plan to engage in more than just colony building and explore all that the pack has to offer, it’s worth considering placing your colony &#D2691E&lfar&r&r enough away from your base so that it stays &#D2691E&noutside of your simulation distance&r&r while you focus on other activities and &#D2691E&lChunkloading&r&r your colony when it's convenient. allowing you to effectively \"pause\" it, giving you the freedom to focus on other tasks as long as you'd like."
				""
				"这种方法&n&#D2691E的缺点&r&r是，你的殖民地不会一直加载。不过，这是一个重要的考量因素，至少在你拥有一个能独立生存和防御的成熟殖民地之前都是如此。"
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
			icon: {
