		{
			dependencies: ["7AA37760F9C6BA7D"]
			description: [
				"&#D2691E&l计算机Craft的Minecolonies&r&r为&#D2691EMinecolonies&r和&#D2691E计算机Craft&r模组提供了整合，让你能读取殖民地信息。可用于状态显示和自动化等。"
				""
				"You’ll now be able to craft the new &#D2691E&lColony Peripheral&r&r block. Place it down in the world anywhere &#D2691Einside your colony borders&r, and then place a computer or turtle either immediately next to it or connected to it via a Wired Modem network."
				""
				"如果计算机已在运行，请在放置外围设备方块后重启它（按住 Ctrl+R）。"
				""
				"Alternatively, you can craft/equip the &#D2691E&lColony Peripheral&r&r onto a &#D2691EPocket Computer&r. This gives you access to the colony API whenever you’re within the borders of any colony where you have the \"Access GUI\" permission (&#D2691Etypically Friend or above&r)."
